From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dynamic Devices BSP Team <support@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 14:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ALSA: compress: import DMA_BUF namespace

The NXP compressed-offload extensions make snd-compress reference
dma_buf_get(), dma_buf_put(), and dma_buf_fd().  Since those symbols are
exported in the DMA_BUF namespace, a modular SND_COMPRESS_OFFLOAD build is
rejected by modpost unless the module explicitly imports that namespace.

Signed-off-by: Dynamic Devices BSP Team <support@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
---
 sound/core/compress_offload.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/sound/core/compress_offload.c b/sound/core/compress_offload.c
index c8abebf606c1..a909437568f6 100644
--- a/sound/core/compress_offload.c
+++ b/sound/core/compress_offload.c
@@ -1501,3 +1501,4 @@
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("ALSA Compressed offload framework");
 MODULE_AUTHOR("Vinod Koul <vinod.koul@linux.intel.com>");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL v2");
+MODULE_IMPORT_NS(DMA_BUF);
-- 
2.43.0
